Error [E0151]: `Gone` is not a declared state of `Crate`
  --> tests/ui/typestate/unknown_transition_from_state_is_e0151.jet:4:5
    |
  4 |     #Transition(Gone, Full) fn fill() -[]> Crate { return Crate{} }
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Typestate (D-STATE-HOME1=A): `struct Crate { state { … } }` defines the valid state labels; `Gone` is not among them — a typo here would silently create a phantom state that no transition reaches
 Fix: Add `Gone` inside `struct Crate { state { … } }`, or correct the spelling
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0151
